P6a probe libgamestream adaptation, based on embedded f32e415.
Use a probe-owned OpenSSL TLS transport to verify the exact DER SHA-256 before
sending any HTTPS request (the macOS system curl TLS backend is not OpenSSL).
Pairing uses authenticated PIN exchange to obtain the in-memory certificate pin.
No HTTP fallback during stream; use the local forwarded HTTPS port; no cancel
or unpair functions or automatic unpair; random client identity; PEM-only keys.
Fix resume XML selection, malformed pairing length checks, and validate the PIN
challenge hash before the final pinned HTTPS request. Pair names are CLI-validated.

